{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7437b25e-95eb-8f68-9584-635e45d62daa",
  "created_at": "2026-01-21T13:19:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Mike Kearney",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:15:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:15:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Kevin. Is it all right if I ask about a drainage problem? I'm on speakerphone, so I hope you can hear me okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:16:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Go ahead, what's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:16:07-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thanks. So there's a catch basin on the lane by my house, and a snowbank from the plow is sitting right on top of it. Nothing's blocking it but the snow, but the melt can't get down, so the water pools right across the lane. It's been like that a few days now. No storm or anything, it's dry out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:16:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the plow pile's sitting on the grate and the melt is backing up across the lane. Got it. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:16:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 193 Memorial Boulevard, the Easton's Beach side. [pause] Is it all right if I ask something else before I forget?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:16:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, shoot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:16:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is that a city drain or a state one? Because Memorial Boulevard, I wasn't sure who handles it. I don't want to be calling the wrong people."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:16:56-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair question. Some of the roads out there are state, but I'd say for a catch basin on a side lane, that's most likely ours. I'll put it in as a city work order, and if it turns out to be state, we'll pass it along to them ourselves. You don't have to chase it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:17:15-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay, that's a relief. Um, the thing is, I've got an older neighbor next door, and she can't really get out. The water's across the whole lane and it's slushy, and with the cold it's going to be ice tonight. I'm worried she'll slip, or just not be able to leave at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:17:33-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's worth flagging. I'll note that there's an elderly neighbor who's stuck behind the water. Let me write this down. Snowbank on the catch basin, water across the lane, one ninety-three Memorial Boulevard, neighbor can't get out. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:17:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Could I, is it all right if I take a quick note while you talk? I want to write down what you tell me so I can tell her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:17:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, take your time. I'll go slow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:18:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Okay, I've got a pen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:18:05-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So here's what happens. I send this to the crew supervisor today, and they'll send somebody to clear the snow off the grate and open up the basin. Probably today or tomorrow, depending on what else is on their list. Until then, if you want, you could try to shovel the snow off the grate yourself, just be careful of traffic out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:18:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I could try that. Is it all right if I ask, would that be okay with the city? I don't want to mess anything up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:18:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Totally fine. Just clear the top of the grate, don't go poking down in it. And if the ice is bad where the water is, throw some salt or sand down for your neighbor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:18:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Got it. Clear the grate, salt for the ice, crew today or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:18:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. And do you want a callback once it's done? I've got a number I can use if you give it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:19:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It's 401-555-0183."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:19:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-three. Great. If it's still pooling tomorrow afternoon, call back and tell them it's the same one, and we'll push it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:19:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I will. Thank you, Kevin. I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:19:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Mike. Stay warm."
    }
  ],
